        <tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:81pt;padding:0;"><p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;padding:0;"><p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">i.</p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;"><p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-align:justify;"><b><u>Outside Date</u>.</b>&nbsp;The Closing has not occurred on or before two business days after the order approving the sale becomes a Final Order ((the &#8220;<b>Termination Date</b>&#8221;&nbsp;or the &#8220;<b>Drop-Dead Date</b>&#8221;), provided that the right to terminate this Agreement under this <u>Section&nbsp;7.9(b)(i)</u>&nbsp;shall not be available to any Party whose failure to fulfill any obligation under this Agreement has been a principal cause of, or resulted in, the failure of the Closing to occur on or before the Termination Date;</p></td>
        </tr>

