    <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-align:justify;"><b>Section 12.9 &nbsp; &nbsp;Severability.</b> If any term or provision of this Agreement is held to be invalid, illegal, or unenforceable in any respect under any applicable Law, the validity, legality, and enforceability of the remaining provisions shall not in any way be affected or impaired thereby, and the Parties shall negotiate in good faith to modify this Agreement so as to effect the original intent of the Parties as closely as possible.</p>
